METHOD | Startup New Corp | START_WIZARD:new_corp
METHOD | Capital Contribution | RUN:./ops/+x/corp_action.+x @corp capital_contribution
METHOD | Public Stock Offering | RUN:./ops/+x/corp_action.+x @corp public_offering
METHOD | Issue Bonds | RUN:./ops/+x/corp_action.+x @corp issue_bonds
METHOD | Buy Back or Call Bonds | RUN:./ops/+x/corp_action.+x @corp call_bonds
METHOD | Extraordinary Dividend | RUN:./ops/+x/corp_action.+x @corp extraordinary_dividend
METHOD | Tax-Free Liquidation | STUB
METHOD | Spin Off Subsidiary | STUB
METHOD | Back to main menu | GOTO:wsr_main_menu